SŁOŬNIKI
==========
A small description of what this repository is. 
This repository is basically the upstream of my dictionaries.
Right now there is only one, but more is planned.
Some day I will realise this and than the repository is going to become public.
Why do I do this? I want to demaskalize belarusian language.
I have nothing to do with movaznaŭstva, but those who have - don't do anything.
So I decided to step in. Even though this will probably be never noticed.
I will have a small changelog for when I decide to actually work on the dictionaries.
